/**
Forward_list: singly linked list

Header File :
<forward_list>

Similarity: same as list ,only difference no push_back or pop_back

Difference:

Insert:
(i) push_front: v.push_front(30)
(ii) insert_after (it,val)
----------------------------------------------------------
Delete:
(i)pop_front: v.pop_front()
(ii)erase_after (it,)
----------------------------------------------------------
Accessing:
--> Using iterator (same as list)
next or advance
---------------------------------------------------------
Traversing:
for(int i  = v.begin() ; i!=v.end() ; i++)
cout<<*i<<" ";
----------------------------------------------------------
Size:
There is no size function in forward_list:
--> distance(v.begin(),v.end());

